    "licence": "ExSight course content",
    "source": {
      "note": "Our own unbranded design after the owner's reference photo (2026-10-11): a tall programmable switching bench supply with V, A and W rows, coarse and fine encoders, OCP/OVP/OUTPUT keys, USB-A and USB-C charging ports. Figures follow current 30 V / 5 A to 60 V / 5 A units of this class (research 08 §C; the listings cited in research 08 §D). Brands are cited in the research only.",
      "research": "bench-work/research/08-component-manifest-research.md",
      "kit": "bench-work/components/classes/dc-supply-switching.mjs"
    }
  },
